MRAC → AEM Delta Ingestion:

SELECT *
FROM MRAC_EVENTS
WHERE last_updated > @last_sync_time

AEM Merge Strategy:

MERGE AEM_EVENTS AS target
USING MRAC_STAGE AS source
ON target.event_id = source.event_id

WHEN MATCHED THEN
    UPDATE SET 
        target.external_flag = 1,
        target.mrac_data = source.data,
        target.updated_at = GETDATE()

WHEN NOT MATCHED THEN
    INSERT (event_id, source_type, created_at)
    VALUES (source.event_id, 'MRAC', GETDATE());


